# Build context hygiene (Task 97): the image build sees sources and manifests,
# never dependencies, build output, local state or anything secret-shaped.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.vitest
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.husky
.idea
.vscode
# Environment files never enter a build context — the .example is documentation.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Local artefacts and archives
*.zip
*.tgz
*.7z
.DS_Store
